o disanje (2-3s udah, 4-6s izdah). Koleno, kuk, trup i rame postaviti u jednu linijiu. Koleno saviti pod pravim uglom. Drugo stopalo postaviti što je moguće bliže perma kuku koji se rasteže. Leđa moraju biti prava u lumbalnom delu, trup visoko postavljen (što vertikalniji). Glava u produžetku kičme visoko postavljena. Gurati kuk koji se rasteže i koleno suprotne noge ka napred svakim udahom","short_note":null,"note":null,"image_url":"https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1Fo7iH0VKbjfUcLX7Xn3IDwRKDbr_INp-","video_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1SLfWp7J1x20eO1ZABLPYVTZSZe6qQbxw/view?usp=sharing","sets":"1","reps":"30+30S","load":null,"item_order":"3","exercise_order":"3","source_row_ref":"536","domain_name":null,"category_name":"Mobility","section_name":"Mobility","domain_color":null,"category_color":"#6aa84f","section_color":"#6aa84f","domain_icon_url":null,"category_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1d4ebsgqCt-4CkTqbBV_FCV_POIuY5cJs/view?usp=drive_link","section_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1d4ebsgqCt-4CkTqbBV_FCV_POIuY5cJs/view?usp=drive_link","domain_short_note":null,"category_short_note":null,"section_short_note":null,"domain_note":null,"category_note":null,"section_note":null,"domain_order":null,"category_order":"3","section_order":"3","exercise_key_type":"code","exercise_key":"472","exercise_expected_name":"Mobilnost kuk i fascija - spoljašnja strana"},{"plan_source_ref":"milos-milovic-102-cleaned-2026-08-18:weekly:2026-07-20","date":"2026-07-23","session_order":"2","node_type":"section","node_name":"Mobility","node_order":"3","item_type":"exercise","title":"Mobilnost rotatora kuka","description":"Tokom vežbe normalno disanje (2-3s udah, 4-6s izdah), leđa moraju biti prava u lumbalnom delu, trup visoko postavljen (što vertikalniji). Glava u produžetku kičme visoko postavljena. Trup zarotirati ka nozi koja je postavljena ka nazad. Tokom vežbe se truditi da se koleno zadnje noge pomera od tela (od centra kuka), pokušati da se sedne na obe s