":"1","item_type":"exercise","title":"Mobilnost spoljašnji rotator kuka u ležanju na leđima","description":"Tokom vežbe normalno disanje (2-3s udah, 4-6s izdah), leđa moraju biti prava u lumbalnom delu. Glava u produžetku kičme visoko postavljena, brada ka grudima pogled ka kolenima usmeren. Tokom vežbe se truditi da se koleno prekrštene noge se aktivno rotira spolja, zadnjicu zadržati na podlozi bez povećavanja krivine kičmenog stuba u lumbalnom delu","short_note":null,"note":null,"image_url":"https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1k891lV82QM0u0gBco_I3InHBx1j7YBLl","video_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1qsgWS8nEuTV2fkNNoL4uefTADbK3lfYm/view?usp=sharing","sets":"1","reps":"20+20s","load":null,"item_order":"2","exercise_order":"2","source_row_ref":"620","domain_name":null,"category_name":"Morning activation","section_name":"mobility/stability","domain_color":null,"category_color":"#6aa84f","section_color":"#fff2cc","domain_icon_url":null,"category_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gx1gj-O-yHh6_HgkCvP6B4rHK6l3CVir/view?usp=drive_link","section_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gx1gj-O-yHh6_HgkCvP6B4rHK6l3CVir/view?usp=drive_link","domain_short_note":null,"category_short_note":null,"section_short_note":null,"domain_note":null,"category_note":null,"section_note":null,"domain_order":null,"category_order":null,"section_order":"1","exercise_key_type":"code","exercise_key":"471","exercise_expected_name":"Mobilnost spoljašnji rotator kuka u ležanju na leđima"},{"plan_source_ref":"milos-milovic-102-cleaned-2026-08-18:weekly:2026-07-20","date":"2026-07-25","session_order":"1","node_type":"section","node_name":"stability2","node_order":"3","item_type":"exercise","title":"Klečeće zaključavanje kuka - ruke iza glave sa postavljanjem noge na steper sa zadrškom","description":"Snažno nogu podići bez dodirivanja podloge stopalom i sa zadrškom 1-2s preći na niski steper. Istovremeno podignuti eksplozivno stranu tela strane stajne noge prema plafonu. Pokušati da se