 disanje. Povećavanjem amplitude može doći do poremećaja disanja i tonusa. To je znak da treba stati, vratiti se malo unazad, udahnuti i tokom kontrolisanog i sporog izdisanja povećati amplitudu do sledeće izazovne pozicije. Kada više nema povećavanja, zadržati tu poziciju 20s. Voditi računa da tokom cele vežbe bude normalno disanje.","short_note":null,"note":null,"image_url":"https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1es8Sgu-iktRvDL40GyMJgLin6GMdqOme","video_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NPm0vGzaTtbGE48BHedH-Y-DNUm0WsDc/view?usp=sharing","sets":"1","reps":"5+5","load":null,"item_order":"4","exercise_order":"4","source_row_ref":"61","domain_name":null,"category_name":"Morning activation","section_name":"mobility/stability","domain_color":null,"category_color":"#6aa84f","section_color":"#fff2cc","domain_icon_url":null,"category_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gx1gj-O-yHh6_HgkCvP6B4rHK6l3CVir/view?usp=drive_link","section_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gx1gj-O-yHh6_HgkCvP6B4rHK6l3CVir/view?usp=drive_link","domain_short_note":null,"category_short_note":null,"section_short_note":null,"domain_note":null,"category_note":null,"section_note":null,"domain_order":null,"category_order":null,"section_order":"1","exercise_key_type":"code","exercise_key":"470","exercise_expected_name":"Brettzel - Rastezanje prednjeg dela"},{"plan_source_ref":"milos-milovic-102-cleaned-2026-08-18:weekly:2026-08-17","date":"2026-08-21","session_order":"1","node_type":"section","node_name":"activation","node_order":"4","item_type":"exercise","title":"Bočna kretanja sa promenama pravca preko niskog stepera","description":"Kretati se što brže levo-desno preko niskog stepera.Dupli konakt sa steperom. Izbaciti grudi tokom zaustavljanja. Izazvati što je moguće jači zvuk. Težište iznad stepera, ne kretati se mnogo levo desno","short_note":null,"note":null,"image_url":"https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1X11ZMSY1h6SXSAgujn82ETAoiRht7fHG","video_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Scdt